  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Applied Innovation Center (AIC) was established to promote the use of emerging Information and Communications Technologies (ICT) in addressing, analysing and solving national challenges, while developing human capital and creating an environment for innovative start-ups to form and grow. The current cooperation between UNDP and Applied Innovation Centre (AIC), affiliated to the Ministry of Communications and Information Technology (MCIT) aims at supporting the AIC to achieve its mission and</narrative>
